01:32:44.070 THIS CHANNEL ANSWERS PACKETS - the default since 2026-09-14. It used to need
01:32:44.071   --set-field-probe, a flag every caller passed and whose absence cost a launch;
01:32:44.071   --silent-channel is the way to turn answering off now, and it is only for
01:32:44.071   eliminating the channel as a variable.
